eng transferred all of his equity in ZK Pipe to ZK International, making ZK Pipe a wholly-owned subsidiary of ZK International. The registered principal activities of ZK Pipe including technical research of metal pipe and fittings, metal take-up valve plumbing and water purifying plant, as well as importing and exporting of goods.","section":"ITEM 4.INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":438,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-000396","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-02-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1687451/000118518526000396/zkin20f012126.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3.bin","sha256":"2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3"}},{"id":"7ba8c9c058a39530f1ab01e895e5eef7edfb98d55c7ac064c0cd92eead6c4532","quote":"Hongyun (Wenzhou) Global Trading Limited. (Hongyun) was incorporated on November 15, 2021 in Wenzhou under the laws of the Peoples Republic of China. The principal activities of Hongyun is trading of nickel materials.","context":"Zhejiang Zhengkang Industrial Co., Ltd., or formerly known as Wenzhou Yafei Valve Manufacturing Co. Ltd (Zhejiang Zhengkang) was incorporated on December 4, 2001 under the laws of the Peoples Republic of China. Zhejiang Zhengkangs registered and paid in capital is RMB 20,000,000. Through equity transfers, Wenzhou Weijia holds 99% of the equity interest of Zhejiang Zhengkang, with the remaining 1% held by our Chairman, Jiancong Huang. The principal activities of Zhejiang Zhengkang include (i) manufacturing and sales of stainless steel band, copper strip, welded stainless steel pipes and fittings, pipe fittings, valve, light industry machinery and equipment and other stainless steel products and (ii) imports and exports of goods and technology.","section":"ITEM 4.INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","