Mr. Ma an annual salary of USD $5,000","context":"(1) Mr. Jiancong Huang resigned as the Chief Executive Officer of the Company, effective October 3, 2025. According to the indefinite employment agreement with Jiancong Huang we have agreed to pay Mr. Huang an annual salary of RMB 780,000 (approximately $85,066). On October 3, 2025, the agreement was terminated.","section":"ITEM 6.DIRECTORS, SENIOR MANAGEMENT AND EMPLOYEES","block":830,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-000396","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-02-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1687451/000118518526000396/zkin20f012126.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3.bin","sha256":"2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3"}},{"id":"d815766d53dc3cb72401550f30de5c18ea96631cbbf29ea0840c9b346a956256","quote":"(3)Xiaofen Jin was appointed the Chief Financial Officer of the Company on July 21, 2023. We entered into an employment agreement with Xiaofen Jin. Pursuant to the agreement, Ms. Jin has accepted the position of Chief Financial Officer and we have agreed to pay Ms. Jin an annual salary of RMB 210,000 (approximately $29,149).","context":"(2) Effective October 3, 2025, Mr. Ruihong Ma was appointed as the director and Chief Executive Officer of the Company. We entered into an employment agreement with Mr. Ruihong Ma. Pursuant to the agreement, Mr. Ma accepted the position of Chief Executive Officer and agreed to pay Mr. Ma an annual salary of USD $5,000","section":"ITEM 6.DIRECTORS, SENIOR MANAGEMENT AND EMPLOYEES","block":831,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-000396","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-02-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://