 fair value of the shares issued had an estimated fair value of $1,185,150 which is measured based on their fair market value on the date of grant.","section":"ITEM 19. EXHIBITS","block":1638,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-000396","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-02-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1687451/000118518526000396/zkin20f012126.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3.bin","sha256":"2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3"}},{"id":"3e3deb75ed09bd593680d7f0254073a2acb2930a9be3ed7ae581edd905e7cda5","quote":"The Company entered into a Securities Purchase Agreement, dated November 27, 2023, with one institutional investor. Pursuant to the Securities Purchase Agreement, the investor purchased, and the Company issued and sold 450,698 shares (3,154,885 prior to split) ordinary shares of the Company, of no par value (the “Shares”), at an aggregate purchase price of $5 million. On April 29, 2024, the Company successfully issued the Shares, marking the closure of the private placement.","context":"2024 Fiscal Year","section":"ITEM 19. EXHIBITS","block":1641,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-000396","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-02-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1687451/000118518526000396/zkin20f012126.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3.bin","sha256":"2931eb36171b6e8b86b02d4341e7aa20503fc2f79452e4e145bf8a91463012a3"}},{"id":"ff9babd825adfb905a239640e59b2f520efd678ccc1d90864c8500f47457599a","quote":"On April 15, 2025, the Company issued 400,000 shares pursuant to a business consulting agreement the 